Z||000000||Haze_Performance||02-23-2001||03:40 AM||||Well I called a glass shop today to ask if I could make an appointment to have the rear window in my 87 SE installed. (I bought the car with a broken window) I told them I had my own glass to put in and they said SURE!! come on by... We can put it in ...in an hour or so.. (Yea Right!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> ) Well an hour or so turned into 4 1/2 hours  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> . The guy told me <B>"PLEASE DONT TELL ANY OTHER FIERO GUYS WE INSTALL REAR WINDOWS"</B> Well he earned the $100.00..hehe  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>At least I can park the car in front of the house now without the snooty BMW driving neighbors calling me White Trash!!! Damn Yuppy Neighbors!!!!!!!!! LOL  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif"> </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>PFF Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1431213" TARGET=_blank><BR>Photopoint Gallery</A>||||reg||7
